{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52808","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 李适之","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代全高尚，玄风阐道微。\n筵开百僚（《广卓异记》作「壶」）饯，诏许二疏归。\n仙记题金籙，朝章换（《广卓异记》作「披」）羽衣。\n悄然承睿藻，行路满光辉。\n（同前。\n以乐史《广卓异记》卷三所录相校。\n《广卓异记》原署「左丞相李适之。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}